@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:私は<br>【遠野ハンナと<br>夏目アンアンが<br>出ていくのを見て】、<br>懲罰房へ向かった。|#0102Trial05_Nanoka002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Eyes1_Pensive_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
